       a named field of one of the three documented ingest payloads, the doc-28 reader fixes the accepted
       token sets, and the alarm evaluator gives Degraded/Down their operator-visible difference. That is a
       property of THIS project, not of the number 95, and nothing here establishes that the remaining 2775
       have the same property. The test is still "can this sentence be recovered", never "is this project
       cheap".

       🔴 AND "DISABLE A CODE" IS TWO DIFFERENT DECISIONS THAT DIFFER BY 448 MEMBERS. Both are forbidden to
